ity", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781607423466, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1775429970684, "description": "", "description_zh": "Bug-Fixer 终极版 - 合并 bug-fixer + bug-fixer-pro 的最佳能力\n\n**触发信号**：\n- \"修bug\"、\"修复bug\"、\"帮我看看这个代码\"\n- \"代码有问题\"、粘贴错误信息\n- \"扫描项目\"、\"自动修复\"\n\n**核心能力**：\n- 确定性规则快速扫描（P0/P1）\n- AI深度分析（P2/P3）\n- 自进化记忆系统\n- 自动修复简单Bug\n- 问题分级报告\n\n**设计理念**：\n- 简单场景用本地规则（快）\n- 复杂场景用AI（准）\n- 从历史中学习（进化）", "downloads": 163, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_00c9b356/bug-fixer-ultimate", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 9, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "一个会\"学习\"的代码医生", "ownerName": "user_00c9b356", "score": 79126.213592233, "slug": "bug-fixer-ultimate", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781607423392, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}]}